A||||4||Mike||Before I buy?
Z||000000||Mike||07-22-99||04:05 PM||||Hi,<p>Before I decide to buy a 1985 Fiero GT I would appreciate some input from the experts.<br>The car has 82,000 miles, automatic, power windors/doors, A/C and the owner is asking $875. Sounds good, but not so fast, it needs work! New Windshield, exterior paint, interior is tired, has some electrical problems with the cooling sensor, radio is missing, and exhaust leak. The V6 appears strong with plenty of life left in it. The current owner is trying to establish a title for the car - as soon as that is resolved he will contact me and I will make him an offer.<p>What am I getting myself into? I have a two car garage and plan on making this a project car. Perhaps converting it to a convertable or a ferrari or something.<p>Thanks for your help<br>Mike 
Z||000001||RICK||07-22-99||05:54 PM||||Sounds like a good deal if it runs and drives and the AC works.  One thing I'd do before giving any money to the person is to have it state inspected.  When I bought mine there was close to $1000.00 of repair work (Pontiac dealer cost) that needed to be done (break lines, front end work, ect.)before it would pass inspection, lucky for me I had planed on doing the work anyway and already had the parts, I just couldnt wait to drive it!!<br>Good Luck<p>ps--dont pay anything to him until he has the title in hand
Z||000002||burdell1||07-22-99||06:12 PM||||Is the exhaust leak from the exhaust manifolds? If so, call your local dealership to find out if any of the recalls have been done on that car. If not, you could possible have something fixed for free that would normally cost around $500. <p>Just out of curiousity, is it red? if so, mine is identical<br>
Z||000003||four50four||07-23-99||05:09 PM||||sounds like a great deal! i've seen gutted parts cars for more. all those sound like pretty simple fixes so if i were you i'd go for it!
Z||000004||Dale||07-28-99||02:28 AM||||Just thought that you would like to know I picked up an 84 se 4 cyl w/81000 miles on it for $500.  needs new paint and a few little things though. good luck
